#: Game.Levels.Preliminaries.L03_cube_of_castHom_ne_zero
msgid "cube_of_castHom_ne_zero"
msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.Preliminaries.L03_cube_of_castHom_ne_zero
msgid "Let $\\Z_9$ be the ring of integers modulo $9$. \\\\\n"
"Let $\\Z_3$ be the ring of integers modulo $3$. \\\\\n"
