"Let $x \\in \\cc{O}_K$. \\\\\\\\\n"
"Then $x^3 - 1 = (x - 1)(x - \\eta)(x - \\eta^ 2)$."
msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.ThirdCyclotomicExtensions.L19_cube_sub_one
msgid "Let $K = \\Q(\\zeta_3)$ be the third cyclotomic field. \\\\\n"
