"Let $x \\in \\cc{O}_K$. \\\\\\\\\n"
"Then $x^3 - 1 = (x - 1)(x - \\eta)(x - \\eta^ 2)$."
msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.ThirdCyclotomicExtensions.L19_cube_sub_one
msgid "Applying *lmm:toInteger_cube_eq_one* and *lmm:toInteger_eval_cyclo*, we have that\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"(x - 1)(x - \\eta)(x - \\eta^ 2)\n"
"&= x^3 - x^2 (\\eta^2 + \\eta + 1) + x (\\eta^2 + \\eta + \\eta^3) - \\eta^3 \\\\\n"
"&= x^3 - x^2 (\\eta^2 + \\eta + 1) + x (\\eta^2 + \\eta + 1) - 1 \\\\\n"
"&= x^3 - 1.\n"
"\\end{align*}"
msgstr ""

