"Let $x \\in \\cc{O}_K$. \\\\\\\\\n"
"If $\\lambda \\divides x + 1$, then $\\lambda^4 \\divides x ^ 3 + 1$."
msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.ThirdCyclotomicExtensions.L22_lambda_pow_four_dvd_cube_add_one_of_dvd_add_one
msgid "By properties of divisibility, if $\\lambda \\divides x + 1$\n"
"then $$\\lambda \\divides - (x + 1) = (- x) - 1.$$\n"
"By *lmm:lambda_dvd_mul_sub_one_mul_sub_eta_add_one*, we can deduce that\n"
"$$\\lambda^ 4 \\divides (-x)^3 - 1.$$\n"
"By divisibility and ring properties we can conclude that $$\\lambda^ 4 \\divides x^3 + 1.$$"
msgstr ""

