#: Game.Levels.FermatSLastTheoremForExponent3.L09_a_cube_b_cube_same_congr
msgid "Since $\\lambda \\notdivides a$, then\n"
"$\\lambda^4 \\divides a^3 - 1 \\lor \\lambda^4 \\divides a^3 + 1$ by\n"
